    '_Every rule is written by somebody imagining the cases they have seen. The test of a rule is the case nobody imagined._',
    '**Rule 1.** _"A second officer must see the identification for any cash withdrawal above 500,000 SYP."_ **The case:** a customer withdraws 480,000 at 10.00 and 450,000 at 10.20, same account, same counter. **The rule is obeyed twice and nearly a million leaves on one document.**',
